{:edb/db-before-t 2366 :edb/db-after-t 2367 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535679 50 #inst "2026-10-09T05:00:30.254Z" 13194139535679 true] [17592186124359 1020 #edb/ref 17592186360804 13194139535679 true] [17592186124359 1020 #edb/ref 17592186360818 13194139535679 true] [17592186124359 1020 #edb/ref 17592186360825 13194139535679 true] [17592186124360 1020 #edb/ref 17592186360811 13194139535679 true] [17592186124360 1020 #edb/ref 17592186360832 13194139535679 true] [17592186360804 1017 #edb/ref 17592186360805 13194139535679 true] [17592186360804 1089 "q-132894" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360804 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535679 true] [17592186360804 1100 "Find ${g}_{xx}(x,y)-{g}_{yy}(x,y)$ at $(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{3})$ given that ${g}_{x}(x,y)=x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+y)$ and ${g}_{y}(x,y)=x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y).$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360804 1113 #uuid "1c3855bf-1622-5d3d-847f-9d7c74379538" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360804 1145 "To find ${g}_{xx}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({g}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+y)) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)+x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+y)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)+x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTo find ${g}_{yy}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${g}_{y}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{yy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({g}_{y}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)) \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNext, we evaluate ${g}_{xx}(x,y)$ and ${g}_{yy}(x,y)$ at $(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{3}):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xx}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{3}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}+\\frac{\\pi }{3})+\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}+\\frac{\\pi }{3})=\\sqrt{3}-\\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\ {g}_{yy}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{3}) & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}+\\frac{\\pi }{3})=-\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\n{g}_{xx}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{3})-{g}_{yy}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{3})=\\sqrt{3}-\\frac{\\pi }{6}-(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\sqrt{3}.\n$$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360806 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360807 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360808 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360809 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360810 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1041 "selection" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360809 13194139535679 true] [17592186360805 1110 #uuid "873de911-186f-5b87-889c-bbe068ce98d2" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360806 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}(\\pi -\\sqrt{3})" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360806 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360806 1111 #uuid "fae74f18-853a-5710-9dc9-d9f14d105b95" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360807 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{3}-\\frac{\\pi }{3})" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360807 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360807 1111 #uuid "47caf0c6-c2e2-542f-a94c-15b9db3ddb84" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360808 1034 "\\sqrt{3}-\\pi " 13194139535679 true] [17592186360808 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360808 1111 #uuid "0eaf434b-c8a7-521f-91da-406c51252b38" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360809 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360809 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360809 1111 #uuid "623a7141-d94a-5d42-8263-2b090887d144" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360810 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{3}+\\pi )" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360810 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360810 1111 #uuid "1f5a6900-a291-5084-94b1-36e25017c628" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360811 1017 #edb/ref 17592186360812 13194139535679 true] [17592186360811 1089 "q-132984" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360811 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535679 true] [17592186360811 1100 "Evaluate ${f}_{xyz}(-1,2,1)$ for $f(x,y,z)={x}^{3}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}-\\frac{3}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡z}.$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360811 1113 #uuid "130ad7f8-2367-56d1-afed-1995cee8fbfb" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360811 1145 "First, we find the first-order derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({z}^{2}{x}^{3}{y}^{2}-\\frac{3}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡z}) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find ${f}_{xy}(x,y,z)$ by differentiating ${f}_{x}(x,y,z)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{x}(x,y,z)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =6{x}^{2}y{z}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{xyz}(x,y,z)$ by differentiating ${f}_{xy}(x,y,z)$ with respect to $z:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xyz}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}({f}_{xy}(x,y,z)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(6{x}^{2}y{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =12{x}^{2}yz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate ${f}_{xyz}(x,y,z)$ at $(-1,2,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xyz}(-1,2,1) & =12(-1)^{2}(2)(1)=24\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360813 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360814 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360815 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360816 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360817 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1041 "selection" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360816 13194139535679 true] [17592186360812 1110 #uuid "0008eab6-b6ff-5522-9bc3-18ed3af8ed73" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360813 1034 "12" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360813 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360813 1111 #uuid "7711932b-125e-5d2c-94e1-24e735a181e1" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360814 1034 "20" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360814 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360814 1111 #uuid "354a7545-e85e-59df-b65d-d2eefb2ac3ea" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360815 1034 "-24" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360815 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360815 1111 #uuid "2528ed8a-e6b9-5549-896f-9cc56b700eb0" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360816 1034 "24" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360816 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360816 1111 #uuid "142d340b-0f5a-5abf-932b-039c8dc51fb6" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360817 1034 "-12" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360817 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360817 1111 #uuid "1bae5314-0108-50bb-97e6-13d0524a8345" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360818 1017 #edb/ref 17592186360819 13194139535679 true] [17592186360818 1089 "q-80403" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360818 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535679 true] [17592186360818 1100 "Find ${f}_{xx}(x,y)+{f}_{yy}(x,y)$ given that  ${f}_{x}(x,y)=-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}$ and ${f}_{y}(x,y)=\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}.$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360818 1113 #uuid "e753edf8-58fc-597a-9f65-e842d6000549" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360818 1145 "To find ${f}_{xx}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =-y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =-y\\cdot (-\\frac{2x}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find ${f}_{yy}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{y}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =x\\cdot (-\\frac{2y}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xx}(x,y)+{f}_{yy}(x,y) & =\\frac{2xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}-\\frac{2xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360820 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360821 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360822 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360823 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360824 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1041 "selection" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360823 13194139535679 true] [17592186360819 1110 #uuid "d4b7b212-9858-5d6a-84ea-83c0249caacb" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360820 1034 "-\\frac{4xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360820 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360820 1111 #uuid "a4e310da-fbab-5cf7-91ee-fd80803c69ba" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360821 1034 "\\frac{4xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360821 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360821 1111 #uuid "e2c57dc7-2cb0-58ad-8793-c754bbdade0e" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360822 1034 "-\\frac{x-y}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360822 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360822 1111 #uuid "294d9d73-fd6b-5737-bd43-44ba4b029f06" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360823 1034 "0" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360823 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360823 1111 #uuid "1116da51-0686-53ac-a717-2a805f4c806f" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360824 1034 "-\\frac{-(x+y)}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360824 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360824 1111 #uuid "5d2ccb86-60ad-528e-8451-25f1cc986782" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360825 1017 #edb/ref 17592186360826 13194139535679 true] [17592186360825 1089 "q-80469" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360825 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535679 true] [17592186360825 1100 "Find ${g}_{xy}(x,y)+{g}_{xx}(x,y)$ given that  ${g}_{x}(x,y)=\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}.$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360825 1113 #uuid "8c97e120-e555-59c4-8223-d7d466a7bcd8" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360825 1145 "To find ${g}_{xy}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({g}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =x\\cdot (-\\frac{2y}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find ${g}_{xx}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({g}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}-\\frac{x}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}\\cdot 2x \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-2{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xy}(x,y)+{g}_{xx}(x,y) & =-\\frac{2xy}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{y}^{2}-2xy-{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360826 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360827 13194139535679 true] [17592186360826 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360828 13194139535679 true] [17592186360826 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360829 13194139535679 true] [1759218636