true] [17592186360832 1145 "First, we find the first-order derivative ${f}_{y}(x,y):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)) \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{yy}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{y}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)) \\\\  & =-{x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find ${f}_{yyx}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{yy}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yyx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{yy}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-{x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)) \\\\  & =-2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)\\cdot y \\\\  & =-2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-{x}^{2}y\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360834 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360835 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360836 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360837 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360838 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1041 "selection" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360836 13194139535679 true] [17592186360833 1110 #uuid "34ec01b2-3288-5a6b-b361-cd1da6ec3772" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360834 1034 "-{x}^{2}y\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360834 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360834 1111 #uuid "dfef15c8-dd5d-5e20-a358-9ff8c6c86bee" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360835 1034 "{x}^{2}y\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360835 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535679 true] [17592186360835 1111 #uuid "7d8b7507-4166-5ec8-8ae0-a5c68714a672" 13194139535679 true] [17592186360836 1034 "-2x\\op